chances are you listened up. Why?

7
00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:44.950
Because you thought I was going to tell a story.

8
00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:50.430
Isn't it interesting how much we love stories, whether it's an enthralling novel, a

9
00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:53.030
