13
00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:17.990
In fact, that's probably one reason why Jesus was so influential.

14
00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:22.570
He told powerful, memorable stories that we can relate to.

15
00:01:22.650 --> 00:01:26.150
The story of the prodigal son. The story of the Good Samaritan.

16
00:01:26.570 --> 00:01:30.650
Any good speaker will tell you that if they want to have an impact on the audience,

17
00:01:30.870 --> 00:01:33.390
