23
00:01:57.390 --> 00:02:00.610
Businessmen sell products by telling stories.

24
00:02:01.030 --> 00:02:05.570
Even kids, when they play make-believe, they play make-believe in stories.

25
00:02:05.910 --> 00:02:11.570
Our lives are stories. But stories are not based on a series of random,

26
00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:13.990
