41
00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:21.230
The very things that are necessary to tell a story.

42
00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:25.570
Stories are about people choosing love, justice and courage.

43
00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:29.630
Now of course in some stories, people fail to make those choices.

44
