00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:17.610
humans need it and further if we live in a universe of ruins

64
00:05:17.610 --> 00:05:22.650
why is there even a built-in structure for storytelling in the universe

65
00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:28.130
how can a chaotic accidental meaningless universe even

66
00:05:28.130 --> 00:05:33.910
build the formula that's universal for storytelling what about

67
