pantheism like naturalism pantheism fails to offer suitable explanation

68
00:05:39.190 --> 00:05:44.750
for story remember on pantheism there is no mind behind the universe

69
00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:50.150
and since meaning comes from a mind in the pantheistic universe there can be no

